error: multiple Git remotes match; select a repository

  remotes: fork → git.example.org/me/gea
           mirror → codeberg.org/perf3ct/gea

what to do:
  choose which remote repository to use.
  1. gea repo set-default  (save the choice in Git config)
  2. gea <command> -R owner/name  (choose for one command)
